# W4-OPENING-1, stage 3 of the full opening: the save that stage 2 wrote after founding, unloading and building
# (--resume <that save>): a city, its stores and the ship's remaining hold come back as they were, the ship is where
# it stopped, and the building tool follows the resumed city. Launch:
#   --ship-start data/maps/candidates/ship-start-v2/lan5-ship-a.json --seat 0 --speed 200 --resume <save>
wait frames 30
wait fact cities == 1 within 60000
expect fact gold == 29350
expect fact store.42 == 7936
expect fact store.41 == 12032
expect fact store.26 == 2560
expect fact ship.1.hold0 == 0
expect fact ship.1.hold3 == 6400
expect fact ship.1.x == 266
expect fact tool == off
expect fact mode == select
lookw 262 134
wait frames 20
# The tool turns on at the resumed city (an occupied tile of the city is known to it).
key b
expect fact tool == on
wait frames 10
screenshot 7-resumed
key b
expect fact tool == off
quit
